**Architectural Layer:** `Next.js 16 App Router & Route Layouts`

App Router pages, layouts, middleware, route guards, and workspace shell entry points (src/app/).

- **Strict SOLID MVVM Data Flow:** `View (.tsx)` → `ViewModel (use*ViewModel.ts)` → `Repository (*Repository.ts)` → `Service (*Service.ts)` → `IApiService`.
- **Design System & Localization:** 100% `@core/ui/*` primitives, Nexus tokens (`--nx-ground`, `--nx-surface`, `--nx-ink`), and co-located `locales/*.en.ts` + `*.ar.ts` dictionaries.

```tsx
// Strict MVVM View consuming ViewModel & Bilingual Locales
const vm = useFeatureViewModel();
const { t } = useTranslation();
return <Card className="bg-nx-surface border-nx-line">{t("feature.title")}</Card>;
```

